{"title":"Lizper Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 52) · Monster drop: Old Mother Ashka, Gutrot The Carver, Ogre Charger, Kragg The Unmoved, Mountain Ogre</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 52 <span class=\"muted\">(5611 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\">Lizper Scale</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 8 of 85 looted corpses (1/11)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 2 of 84 looted corpses (1/42)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/42<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 2 of 85 looted corpses (1/43)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/43<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 1 of 428 looted corpses (1/428)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/428<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 3 of 1,439 looted corpses (1/480)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/480<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"lizper-legs\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1f1604dc88f4e382bd7e.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b79092ee4a292010c666.svg\" alt=\"\">Lizper Scale</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/639e656beda54ecb8321.svg\" alt=\"Lizper Legs\"></div><h3>Lizper Legs</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 52</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>5 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/28/2026, 7:35:29 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}